.TH "HYPR-CYCLE-LAYOUT" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hypr\-cycle\-layout \- switch between Master and Dwindle Hyprland layouts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBhypr\-cycle\-layout\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the current general:layout option and switch between master and dwindle. If the current layout is neither, select master.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires an active Hyprland instance, hyprctl and awk.
.SH OPERATION
The current general:layout value is obtained using hyprctl
getoption. Master changes to dwindle, dwindle to master,
and any unrecognised layout is reset to master. This modifies
the running compositor immediately; it does not rewrite the
configuration file.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
hyprctl getoption general:layout
hypr-cycle-layout
hyprctl getoption general:layout
.fi
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
If hyprctl cannot connect, verify HYPRLAND_INSTANCE_SIGNATURE
and that the command runs inside the correct graphical session.
For the keyboard shortcut assigned to this helper, consult
hyprland-keys(7).
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires hyprctl and awk in an active Hyprland session.
.SH OPERATION
Reads the current general:layout setting, switches master to
dwindle or dwindle to master, and resets unknown layouts to
master. Changes affect the running compositor only.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
hyprctl getoption general:layout
hypr-cycle-layout
hyprctl getoption general:layout
.fi
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
If hyprctl cannot connect, check the Hyprland instance signature
and that the command is executed in the intended session.
.SH SEE ALSO
hyprland\-keys(7), hyprctl(1)
